    "text": "Hw\u00e6t w\u00e6s se on \u00feissere worulde se\u00f0e ac\u00e6nned n\u00e6s, & \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere w\u00e6s to men geworden & lange\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s adam se \u00e6resta mann \u00fee \u00feis bi gelumpen w\u00e6s.\nAnd for \u00feon hine se eor\u00f0e gretan ne meahte \u00fe\u00e6t he fulode & brosnode.\nFor \u00feon \u00fee he of \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an selfre unm\u00e6ngedre \u00e6r gesceapen w\u00e6s & gehiwad \u00feurh godes\nHwile w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t bett meahte o\u00f0\u00f0e gemet mannes on eor\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t he swa cr\u00e6ftlic weorc gefegde tosomne,\nAnd he lifde, adam, \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re menniscan hiwunge dcccc wintra & \u00ferittig wintra.\nAnd \u00fee sexteo\u00feegan geare fram his hiwunge \u00fe\u00e6t he gegylte on neorxnawonge unges\u00e6lilice ofer godes\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s friged\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fea bl\u00e6de \u00feigdon adam & eua & heo eft swulton butu on friged\u00e6g.\nAnd \u00fea eft \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t hie butu w\u00e6ron on helle adam & eua for \u00fe\u00e6s gyltes mycelnysse fif \u00feusend\nAdam w\u00e6s eac swi\u00f0e weor\u00f0lic hiserinc \u00fea hine god \u00e6rest gehiwad h\u00e6fde to m\u00e6nniscum gesceape on\nAnd he w\u00e6s on l\u00e6nge on fif & hund nigontiges fingra lenge ofer \u00feweoras \u00fea fingras on medemre\nSarra w\u00e6s haten abrahames cwen.\nRebecca w\u00e6s haten isaaces cwen.\nRachel w\u00e6s haten iacobes cwen.\nAnd \u00e6ft w\u00e6s \u00e6fter \u00feon cwen iudiht w\u00e6s wuduwe seo w\u00e6s samueles modor \u00fe\u00e6s witegan.\n\u00deonne w\u00e6s noemi melches wyf iudisc mann.\nFurtumatus sette \u00feas naman ealle to meterferse.\nNoe se heah f\u00e6der h\u00e6fde \u00fery sunu \u00fea w\u00e6ron \u00feus hatene, sem, cham, iaphet.\nAnd of \u00feam \u00ferim sunum wear\u00f0 onw\u00e6cnad & awridad eall manna cynn wear\u00f0 on besenced & \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6fre\nAnd he eac \u00fea gyt nolde urne drihten for his myldheortnesse \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00f0es middangeard n\u00e6re ortydre\nAnd of him \u00ferim eft wear\u00f0 awridad twa & hund seofontig \u00feeoda ealdorlicra m\u00e6g\u00f0a.\nAnd swa fela is eac manna gereorda & heora gespr\u00e6c tod\u00e6led.\n\u00deonne awoc \u00e6rest of iafe\u00f0e noes suna XV m\u00e6g\u00f0a ealdorlicere & micele.\n\u00deonne onwocon of chame XXX theoda mycelra & eac \u00fe\u00e6t cynn w\u00e6s geseald fram urum drihtne \u00feam\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s for \u00feon swa gedon \u00fe\u00e6t he get\u00e6lde his f\u00e6der noe \u00fe\u00e6r he on his sceape locode & his to\n\u00d0onne onwoc fram \u00feam \u00f0riddan suna seme, & se wes heora geongost w\u00e6s \u00feeh hw\u00e6\u00f0ere on wisdome\nAnd \u00feanon w\u00e6s aw\u00e6cnod \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00feeluste cynn & \u00fe\u00e6t betste.\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s for \u00feon \u00fee he his f\u00e6der noe na get\u00e6lde & untweogendlice of \u00feysum \u00ferim mannum noes\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t he tod\u00e6lde for \u00fe\u00e6re t\u00e6lnysse \u00fee hy heora f\u00e6der t\u00e6ldon noe \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00f0reo towearp \u00fea\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s w\u00e6lisc & on cyrlisc cynn & on gesy\u00f0cund cynd.\nFor \u00feyssum gyltengum \u00fee we nu gehyrdon w\u00e6ron \u00fea gesyblingas \u00feus tod\u00e6lde.\n\u00deis syndon \u00fea \u00f0reo frigedagas \u00fee man sceall f\u00e6sten on twelf mon\u00feum.\nSe \u00e6resta on hlydan, & se \u00e6ftresta \u00fee by\u00f0 on iulius.\nSe mann \u00fee \u00feis gef\u00e6st ne \u00feearf, he na ondr\u00e6don him helle wita butan he beo hlafordswica.\nBe sancta maria ylde and be hyre for\u00f0si\u00f0e.\nSancta maria w\u00e6s XIIII winter \u00fea heo crist ac\u00e6nde, & sy\u00f0\u00f0an heo w\u00e6s mid him XXXIII wintra on\nAnd heo leofode XIIII gear \u00e6fter him her on worulde, & heo w\u00e6s LXIII wintra \u00fea heo for\u00f0ferde.\nAnd se h\u00e6lend w\u00e6s \u00ferittig \u00fea hine mann fullude.\nBe misd\u00e6da.\nGif hwa fulice on ungecyndelicum \u00feingum ongean godes gesceafte \u00feurh \u00e6nig \u00feine hine sylfne besmite,",
